{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"mdeet-2017-chemistry-11","exam":"MDEET","year":2017,"subject":"chemistry","number":11,"points":4,"unitId":"equilibrium","unitLabel":"화학 평형","topic":"평형반응·Ksp·평형상태","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["equilibrium","stereo"],"stem":"다음은 AgCl(s)의 용해와 관련된 평형 반응식이다.\nAgCl(s)⇄Ag+(aq)+Cl−(aq)\nKsp =2.0×10−10\nAg+(aq)+Cl−(aq)⇄AgCl(aq)\nK1=2.0×103\nAgCl(aq)+Cl−(aq)⇄AgCl2\n−(aq)\nK2=1.0×102\nAgCl(s)을 물에 용해시킨 용액 1과 0.10M NaCl 수용액에 용해시킨 \n용액 2에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 \n것은? (단, 평형 상태에서 AgCl(s)이 남아 있다.)\n<보 기>\nㄱ. Ag+(aq)의 농도는 용액 1이 용액 2보다 크다.\nㄴ. AgCl(aq)의 농도는 두 용액에서 같다.\n−(aq)의 농도는 용액 2가 용액 1보다 크다.\nㄷ. AgCl2","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03","fig-04","fig-05","fig-06","fig-07","fig-08"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t018"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t020"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t021"]}],"answer":5,"acceptedAnswers":[5],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":35,"height":32,"region":0,"bbox":[88.7,4.315,14.0,12.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2017-chemistry-11/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":611,"height":35,"region":0,"bbox":[41.1,36.715,244.4,14.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t002","t003"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2017-chemistry-11/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":605,"height":37,"region":0,"bbox":[29.1,59.115,242.0,14.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t004","t005"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2017-chemistry-11/03.webp"},{"id":"fig-04","width":575,"height":37,"region":0,"bbox":[41.1,81.515,230.0,14.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t006","t007","t008"],"src"